 〜 ’11. 2. 25)<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;※ </span>의무 사항<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ❍ 학기 중 「방과후학교」영어수업 지원(팀티칭)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -40.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ❍ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">방학 중 캠프 등 각종 영어프로그램을 포함한 경북교육청, 지역교육청, 학교가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> 지정하는 기타 업무 지원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ❍ 교내 각종 영어교육활동 및 학교와 지역사회의 특별활동 지원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ❍ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">수업 전․후 또는 공휴일에 원어민장학생과 상호 협의 하에 한국 생활</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">적응 지원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ❍ 여가시간을 활용한 원어민장학생의 한국체험활동 지원<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;※&nbsp;</span>장학 혜택 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21.2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">❍ 활동비 지급 : 수업 보조 1시간당 14,000원 지급(월 50만원 내외) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21.2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 수업 보조 시간은 1일 3시간으로 주당 3시간, 6시간, 9시간으로 선택 가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21.2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">❍</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> 활동완료시 정부초청 해외영어봉사 장학생 인증서 발급 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 41.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21.2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">❍ 원어민과의 1:1 대화 기회 확대로 영어사용능력, 국제이해도 제고</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’HY헤드라인M’\"><font size=\"2\">2. 선발 방법, 인원, 자격</font>&nbsp;<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;※ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">선발 방법 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 158.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -158.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 교육감 : 홍보(공고 및 대학에 공문 발송)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 158.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -158.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학교장 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 158.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -158.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;❍ 선발 : 원서접수, 심사, 합격자통보, 협약서 작성<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;※ </span>선발 인</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"><strong>원</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> : 국내대학 재학(휴학생, 졸업생 포함) 89명</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 158.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -158.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ❍ 배치 중심학교 및 순회학교에서 각각 선발 가능하나 해외영어봉사</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 158.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -158.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;장학생 1인당 국내대학생은 9시간까지만 가능함(순회학교에서 국내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 158.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -158.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;대학장학생 필요시 중심학교와 협의<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><!--StartFragment--></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 158.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -158.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: